('APX-S-3835-1', 'APX-C-3835', 1, null, null, null, 'Create a 5-second cinematic route-guide clip for a walking navigation video. Continuity: This is scene {N} of 5 in a route from North Avenue MARTA Station to Coda Tech Square in Atlanta. The guide is the same stylish female tour guide in every scene: black sunglasses, sleeveless cream belted dress, brown leather belt, tour lanyard, small shoulder bag, brown hair tied back, confident warm expression.', null, null, 'Continuity: This is scene {N} of 5 in a route from North Avenue MARTA Station to Coda Tech Square in Atlanta. The guide is the same stylish female tour guide in every scene: black sunglasses, sleeveless cream belted dress, brown leather…', null, null, null, null, 'station, square', null),
('APX-S-3835-2', 'APX-C-3835', 2, null, null, null, 'She appears on the sidewalk or plaza only, never in traffic lanes. Scene role: {route_step} Starting frame: Use the supplied Street View image as the real-world location reference. Preserve the recognizable street layout, building massing, sidewalk direction, signage, and lighting.', null, null, 'She appears on the sidewalk or plaza only, never in traffic lanes.', null, null, null, null, 'plaza', null),
('APX-S-3835-3', 'APX-C-3835', 3, null, null, null, 'Action: The guide is already in frame, slightly ahead of the viewer. She turns toward the camera, gestures toward the next walking direction, then begins to lead the viewer forward. Camera: Smooth handheld walking pace, slight forward push-in, no jumpy zooms, no orbit.', null, null, 'She turns toward the camera, gestures toward the next walking direction, then begins to lead the viewer forward.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3835-4', 'APX-C-3835', 4, null, null, null, 'Keep horizon stable. The final second should frame the direction of the next scene so the edit can cut naturally. End frame: End with the camera facing {next_direction_or_landmark}, with the guide near the edge of frame pointing forward.', null, null, 'End frame: End with the camera facing {next_direction_or_landmark}, with the guide near the edge of frame pointing forward.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3835-5', 'APX-C-3835', 5, null, null, null, 'Restrictions: Do not invent a different city, indoor location, parking lot, or tourist group. Do not place the guide in the road. Do not block crosswalks, street signs, building entrances, or the Coda facade.', null, null, 'Restrictions: Do not invent a different city, indoor location, parking lot, or tourist group. Do not place the guide in the road. Do not block crosswalks, street signs, building entrances, or the Coda facade.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
