('APX-S-3739-1', 'APX-C-3739', 1, null, null, null, 'Use the uploaded 2x2 @image1 grid as a contact sheet of memories, not as a literal grid. Transform the individual photos into one cohesive nostalgic music video sequence about the same young man and young woman falling in love through candid iPhone moments. Create a 12–15 second emotional indie-pop MV montage.', null, null, 'Transform the individual photos into one cohesive nostalgic music video sequence about the same young man and young woman falling in love through candid iPhone moments.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
