('APX-S-3678-1', 'APX-C-3678', 1, null, null, null, '**Environment:** A massive open grassland beneath a rotating supercell thunderstorm. Dark cloud walls spiral across the sky while continuous lightning flashes illuminate the rolling plains. Rain sweeps sideways through violent wind gusts. **Action:** 15.0s sequence.', null, null, 'Environment:** A massive open grassland beneath a rotating supercell thunderstorm. Dark cloud walls spiral across the sky while continuous lightning flashes illuminate the rolling plains. Rain sweeps sideways through violent wind gusts.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3678-2', 'APX-C-3678', 2, null, null, null, null, 271, 224, 'A giant wolf composed of living lightning sprints across the storm-soaked terrain, electricity branching from its paws with every stride. A colossal thunderbird descends from the clouds, wings generating powerful shockwaves.', null, 'sprinting', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3678-3', 'APX-C-3678', 3, null, null, null, 'They collide across the storm plain as the wolf leaps into the air while lightning arcs between both creatures. Velocity Ramp choreography: the moment the wolf’s electrified claws strike the thunderbird slows dramatically, revealing branching lightning fractals before snapping back as both creatures explode apart in a burst of electrical energy. **Camera:** Handheld tracking shot racing through rain-soaked grass, occasionally catching lightning reflections in flooded ground before tilting upward toward the airborne clash. **Style & Constraints:** Volumetric rain simulation, photorealistic lightning arcs, cinematic storm lighting, ray-traced reflections on wet surfaces, 8K resolution.', null, null, 'They collide across the storm plain as the wolf leaps into the air while lightning arcs between both creatures.', null, 'leaping; racing', null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3689-1', 'APX-C-3689', 1, null, null, null, 'Ultra-realistic retrofuturistic megacity at night, colossal orbital tower rising beyond storm clouds, warning lights flashing along its height, rain and neon haze below. A glass high-speed elevator rockets upward along the outside of the tower at extreme speed, city lights shrinking rapidly beneath it.', null, null, 'Retrofuturistic megacity at night, colossal orbital tower rising beyond storm clouds, warning lights flashing along its height, rain and neon haze below.', null, null, null, null, 'tower', null),
('APX-S-3689-2', 'APX-C-3689', 2, null, null, null, 'Inside the elevator, a bruised female survivor struggles to stay upright, breathing hard, determined. Broken steel cables rip free from the cabin walls and spiral around her body, forming sleek magnetic armor with glowing seams.', null, null, 'Broken steel cables rip free from the cabin walls and spiral around her body, forming sleek magnetic armor with glowing seams.', null, null, null, null, 'cabin', null),
