('APX-S-3676-1', 'APX-C-3676', 1, null, null, null, 'SUBJECT: A drained young woman matching reference. She wears an oversized faded t-shirt and soft lounge shorts. Hair slightly messy, faint smudged kajal under her eyes, barefoot. Her movements are slow, automatic, almost like muscle memory rather than intention. Expression distant, unfocused. ENVIRONMENT: A narrow, low-ceiling studio apartment. A thin mattress pushed against the wall, rumpled sheets, clothes draped over a chair. A tight passage leads into a small wash area with a cracked mirror and damp floor.', null, null, 'She wears an oversized faded t-shirt and soft lounge shorts. Hair slightly messy, faint smudged kajal under her eyes, barefoot. Her movements are slow, automatic, almost like muscle memory rather than intention.', null, null, null, null, 'studio, apartment', null),
('APX-S-3676-2', 'APX-C-3676', 2, null, null, null, 'Beyond that, a compact kitchenette with stacked utensils, a flickering tube light, and a half-open window letting in tinted city glow. The space feels humid, stale, and lived-in. MOOD: Repetitive routine with an eerie undertone, like something unseen is quietly observing from above, waiting for a break in pattern. COLOR LOGIC: Muted tungsten warmth mixed with artificial green spill from outside. Slight haze in the air, soft diffusion on highlights, subtle noise for realism.', null, null, 'Beyond that, a compact kitchenette with stacked utensils, a flickering tube light, and a half-open window letting in tinted city glow. The space feels humid, stale, and lived-.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3676-3', 'APX-C-3676', 3, null, null, null, 'CAMERA: Strict top-down POV tracking perfectly vertical above her head at all times. No tilt, no drift, no lateral offset. Smooth floating motion, phasing through ceilings and doorways seamlessly. 24mm lens feel, clean digital texture. Continuous single take. SCENE FLOW: She lies on the mattress, eyes open already, not waking, just… existing. Sits up directly beneath the lens. Without looking up, reaches beside her pillow. Finds a crumpled cigarette pack. Taps one out.', null, null, 'SCENE FLOW: She lies on the mattress, eyes open already, not waking, just… existing. Without looking up, reaches beside her pillow.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3676-4', 'APX-C-3676', 4, null, null, null, 'Places it between her lips. Searches briefly. Finds the lighter under the sheet. Lights it. The flame flickers briefly against her face. She inhales. Drops the lighter. She stands. The camera glides with her, perfectly locked overhead. Walks slowly through the cramped room, stepping over scattered clothes. Enters the narrow passage. Moves into the wash area. With the cigarette held loosely in one hand, she turns on the tap using the other. Lets water run over her fingers first.', null, null, 'Places it between her lips. The flame flickers briefly against her face. The camera glides with her, perfectly locked overhead. With the cigarette held loosely in one hand, she turns on the tap using the other.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3676-5', 'APX-C-3676', 5, null, null, null, 'Then splashes her face lazily, not fully committing. Water drips. She doesn’t wipe it. She exits back into the passage, trailing faint smoke. Turns into the kitchenette. Still under the exact center of the frame, she reaches toward the cluttered counter. Moves aside a plate without looking. Picks up a steel tumbler. Pauses. Stands still. The camera remains frozen above her. She raises the cigarette slightly. Takes a slow drag. Silence stretches. Then, she slowly tilts her head upward.', null, null, 'Then splashes her face lazily, not fully committing. She exits back into the passage, trailing faint smoke. Still under the exact center of the frame, she reaches toward the cluttered counter. The camera remains frozen above her.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3676-6', 'APX-C-3676', 6, null, null, null, 'Not sudden. Not sharp. Just enough to meet the lens. Holds eye contact. Exhales smoke straight up, it blooms toward the camera, soft and hazy. Doesn’t break the gaze. SFX: Soft lighter click, inhale/exhale, distant traffic hum, faint electrical buzz, water trickle, bare feet against floor. Subtle room tone with low ambient tension.', null, null, 'Exhales smoke straight up, it blooms toward the camera, soft and hazy.', null, null, null, null, null, 'intense'),
('APX-S-3666-1', 'APX-C-3666', 1, null, null, null, 'Luxury Cream Cinematic Ad (Female Model – Reference Matched) A cinematic, high-end luxury skincare advertisement featuring a young woman whose face closely matches the provided reference image — accurate facial structure, skin tone, hairstyle, and expression consistency across all frames. She stands in a softly lit, premium indoor setting (minimalist luxury room with warm natural light filtering through sheer curtains).', null, null, 'She stands in a softly lit, premium indoor setting (minimalist luxury room with warm natural light filtering through sheer curtains).', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3666-2', 'APX-C-3666', 2, null, null, null, 'The atmosphere feels calm, refined, and elegant. She is wearing a tasteful red outfit — a modest yet attractive dress consisting of a skirt extending just below her knees and a half-sleeve top, made of soft, flowing fabric. The styling is minimal and sophisticated, with subtle makeup and natural hair movement. 🎥 Scene Flow & Shots 1. Wide Shot (Establishing) The woman stands gracefully near a window, gentle sunlight illuminating her silhouette.', null, null, 'She is wearing a tasteful outfit — a modest yet attractive dress consisting of a skirt extending just below her knees and a half-sleeve top, made of soft, flowing fabric.', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
('APX-S-3666-3', 'APX-C-3666', 3, null, null, null, 'Curtains flow slightly, adding softness and motion. 2. Medium Shot (Introduction of Product) She slowly raises a luxury skincare cream jar in her hands. The jar is sleek, glossy, and premium-looking (glass container with metallic accents). She looks at it with a soft, confident smile. 3. Close-Up (Product Focus) Detailed macro shot of her hands holding the cream. Soft reflections, visible texture, and premium finish emphasized.', null, null, '(Introduction of Product) She slowly raises a luxury skincare cream jar in her hands. She looks at it with a soft, confident smile. Close-Up (Product Focus) Detailed of her hands holding the cream.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-3666-4', 'APX-C-3666', 4, null, null, null, 'Condensation or glow effect can be added subtly for luxury appeal. 4. Beauty Shot (Emotional Connect) Camera shifts to her face — she looks into the camera with a calm, elegant expression. Slight head tilt, natural blinking, soft smile. 5. Interaction Shot She gently opens the jar, lightly dabs a small amount of cream, and applies it gracefully (e.g., on her cheek or hand), maintaining poise and elegance.', null, null, 'Beauty Shot (Emotional Connect) Camera shifts to her face — she looks into the camera with a calm, elegant expression. Interaction Shot She gently opens the jar, lightly dabs a small amount of cream, and applies it gracefully (e.g., on her…', null, null, null, null, null, 'calm'),
